# Sonos Radio Agent — example requests for Homey / REST client
# Replace the placeholders: {{host}}, {{token}}, {{scene_id}}

@host = http://192.168.1.50:8080
@token = your-api-token-here
@scene_id = fm4-living-room

### Health (no token)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/health

### List scenes
GET {{host}}/api/v1/scenes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start a scene
POST {{host}}/api/v1/scenes/{{scene_id}}/play
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Speakers on the LAN
GET {{host}}/api/v1/speakers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Playback status of all scenes
GET {{host}}/api/v1/scenes/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
